Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Ashley Curtis work for?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 17, "text": "**Breaking News**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 19, "end": 103, "text": "Renowned Researcher Ashley Curtis Joins Kyung Hee University Medical Center in Seoul"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 105, "end": 324, "text": "Seoul, South Korea - In a move that is set to revolutionize the healthcare landscape in South Korea, esteemed researcher Ashley Curtis has joined the esteemed Kyung Hee University Medical Center as a leading researcher."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 325, "end": 438, "text": "This development is expected to bring a fresh wave of innovation and expertise to the medical community in Seoul."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 439, "end": 649, "text": "According to sources close to the matter, Curtis, a renowned expert in the field of regenerative medicine, will be heading a new research team focused on developing cutting-edge treatments for chronic diseases."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 650, "end": 781, "text": "Her appointment is seen as a major coup for the medical center, which has been at the forefront of medical research in South Korea."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 782, "end": 810, "text": "\"We are thrilled to have Dr."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 811, "end": 837, "text": "Curtis on board,\" said Dr."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 838, "end": 899, "text": "Lee Ji-Hoon, Director of Kyung Hee University Medical Center."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 900, "end": 1093, "text": "\"Her wealth of experience and expertise in regenerative medicine will undoubtedly elevate our research capabilities and contribute significantly to the advancement of medical science in Korea.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1094, "end": 1239, "text": "Curtis, who has published numerous papers on stem cell therapy and tissue engineering, expressed her excitement about joining the medical center."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1240, "end": 1410, "text": "\"I am honored to be a part of this esteemed institution and look forward to collaborating with the talented team of researchers here,\" she said in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1411, "end": 1499, "text": "\"Together, we can make a meaningful impact on the lives of patients and their families.\""}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1500, "end": 1689, "text": "Data released by the medical center reveals that Curtis's research team has already made significant strides in developing a novel treatment for Parkinson's disease using stem cell therapy."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1690, "end": 1849, "text": "The treatment, which is currently in the clinical trial phase, has shown promising results in reducing symptoms and improving the quality of life for patients."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1850, "end": 1944, "text": "\"Ashley's work has the potential to transform the way we approach disease treatment,\" said Dr."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1945, "end": 2005, "text": "Kim Tae-Hyun, a colleague of Curtis's at the medical center."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2006, "end": 2109, "text": "\"Her passion and dedication to her work are truly inspiring, and we are lucky to have her on our team.\""}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2110, "end": 2231, "text": "Curtis's appointment is seen as a major boost to the medical center's reputation as a hub for medical innovation in Asia."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2232, "end": 2401, "text": "Her presence is expected to attract top talent from around the world and further solidify Kyung Hee University Medical Center's position as a leader in medical research."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2402, "end": 2547, "text": "As Curtis settles into her new role, the medical community in Seoul is abuzz with excitement about the possibilities that her research may bring."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 111, "text": "Title: The Academic Pursuits of Ashley Curtis: Unraveling the Threads of Research at the University of Missouri"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 113, "end": 332, "text": "In the heart of Columbia, Missouri, a hub of intellectual curiosity and discovery thrives at the University of Missouri, a public research university renowned for its commitment to advancing knowledge and understanding."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 333, "end": 460, "text": "It is within these hallowed halls that Ashley Curtis, a dedicated researcher, left an indelible mark on the academic community."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 461, "end": 668, "text": "This narrative delves into the life and work of Ashley Curtis, meticulously weaving together the threads of evidence that unequivocally support the claim: Ashley Curtis worked for the University of Missouri."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 669, "end": 712, "text": "Chapter 1: The Early Years of Ashley Curtis"}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 714, "end": 859, "text": "Ashley Curtis's academic journey began with a passion for learning, nurtured by a supportive family and a natural aptitude for critical thinking."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 860, "end": 975, "text": "As a student, Curtis demonstrated a keen interest in the sciences, exceling in biology, chemistry, and mathematics."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 976, "end": 1065, "text": "This foundation would later serve as the springboard for a distinguished research career."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1066, "end": 1111, "text": "Chapter 2: The University of Missouri Beckons"}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1113, "end": 1299, "text": "After completing undergraduate studies, Curtis set her sights on the University of Missouri, drawn by its esteemed reputation for research excellence and interdisciplinary collaboration."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1300, "end": 1459, "text": "In 2005, Curtis was accepted into the university's prestigious graduate program, marking the beginning of a fruitful association that would span several years."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1460, "end": 1493, "text": "Chapter 3: Research and Discovery"}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1495, "end": 1557, "text": "As a graduate student, Curtis worked under the guidance of Dr."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1558, "end": 1617, "text": "Jane Smith, a renowned expert in the field of microbiology."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1618, "end": 1741, "text": "Together, they embarked on a groundbreaking research project investigating the antimicrobial properties of novel compounds."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1742, "end": 1932, "text": "Curtis's contributions to the project were instrumental in securing a grant from the National Science Foundation, a testament to the university's commitment to fostering innovative research."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1933, "end": 1971, "text": "Chapter 4: Publication and Recognition"}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1973, "end": 2099, "text": "The findings of Curtis's research were published in the esteemed Journal of Microbiology, a leading international publication."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2100, "end": 2133, "text": "The article, co-authored with Dr."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2134, "end": 2262, "text": "Smith, garnered significant attention within the scientific community, earning Curtis recognition as a rising star in her field."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2263, "end": 2434, "text": "This publication serves as concrete evidence of Curtis's affiliation with the University of Missouri, as the article explicitly lists her affiliation with the institution."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2435, "end": 2481, "text": "Chapter 5: University Records and Testimonials"}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2483, "end": 2662, "text": "A thorough examination of university records reveals Curtis's enrollment in the graduate program, as well as her participation in various academic and research-related activities."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2663, "end": 2731, "text": "Furthermore, testimonials from colleagues and mentors, including Dr."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2732, "end": 2868, "text": "Smith, attest to Curtis's dedication, work ethic, and significant contributions to the research community at the University of Missouri."}}, "candidates": [], "original_cards": [], "initial_answers": ["Kyung Hee University Medical Center", "University of Missouri"]}
